    'product-image-prompt': ['接收有效上游产物、版本和 Gate 证据，仅执行对应流水线阶段；输出实际结论与回退位置，不能跳过前序门禁。', 'Receive valid upstream artifacts, versions and gate evidence; execute only this pipeline stage and report its actual outcome and return stage without bypassing prerequisites.'],
    'requirement-clarification': ['接收已有事实、材料、角色和问题；沿用明确决定与项目知识目录，少量澄清后标明阶段结论与剩余缺口。', 'Receive facts, sources, roles and questions; reuse decisions and project knowledge locations, clarify consequential gaps and report the stage outcome.'],
    'requirement-analysis': ['接收有效澄清结果与来源版本；区分根因证据和假设，输出范围、非目标、规则、风险和验证指标及阶段结论。', 'Receive clarification artifacts and versions; distinguish causal evidence from assumptions, then report scope, exclusions, rules, risks, metrics and the stage outcome.'],
