    'prd-writing': ['接收已确认方案、来源路径和版本；沿用权威目录，输出含异常及验收标准的 PRD 与稿件版本，结束标记 READY_FOR_REVIEW 不代表放行。', 'Receive agreed solutions, source paths and versions; write the PRD in the authoritative location with exceptions, acceptance criteria and a draft version. READY_FOR_REVIEW is not approval.'],
    'requirement-review': ['接收并核实需求稿件路径及版本；只审不改，记录 S0–S3、影响、关闭条件与复审要求；独立一行写实际的一种需求评审结论（GO、CONDITIONAL GO 或 NO-GO），需回退时按 Skill ID 另列回退阶段。', 'Verify artifact path and version; audit without edits, record S0–S3 findings, impact, closing conditions and re-review requirements. Emit exactly one line “Requirements review outcome: GO”, “Requirements review outcome: CONDITIONAL GO” or “Requirements review outcome: NO-GO”; emit “Return stage: <skill-id>” when revision is needed.'],
    'product-development-pipeline': ['接收最初想法、有效产物版本与已有决定；以完整流水线推进至生图提示词，核对依赖并记录各阶段 Gate 和回退，显式指定其他终点时遵循；不实际生图、不因中间 PASS 启动编码或替代工程门禁。', 'Receive the initial idea, valid artifact versions and decisions; follow the full pipeline through every gate to UI image prompts unless another endpoint is explicitly requested. Record dependencies and return stages; do not generate images, start coding or replace engineering gates.'],
